A refused plus is escaped when the block below would attach

```
- - +

  > q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

````
- - +

  ```
  x
  ```
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
````

```
- - +

  # H
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    <h1 id="H">H</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- - +

  {.c}
  > q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    <blockquote class="c"><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- foo
  1. +
   > b
.
<ul>
  <li>foo
    <ol>
      <li></li>
    </ol>
    <blockquote><p>b</p></blockquote>
